---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
---
<BaseLayout title="Writing — Barney Pinkerton">
  <div class="page-content">
    <h1>Writing</h1>
    <p class="page-intro">A selection of essays, creative pieces and reflections on music, data, and culture. Each card includes a short excerpt — click to read the full piece inline.</p>

    <div class="card reveal">
      <h2>Music Technology Experience: Mister Sundays @Nowadays</h2>
      <div class="card-meta">NYU · Reflection · 2025</div>
      <p><em>"Within minutes, the mundane formalities that dominate day to day life begin to fade to black — replaced by rhythm, colour, and shared energy."</em></p>
      <button class="read-btn desktop-only" data-pdf="true" data-src="/assets/writing/NYU%20Music%20Technology%20Experience.pdf">▶&nbsp; Read inline</button>
      <a class="mobile-link mobile-only" href="/assets/writing/NYU%20Music%20Technology%20Experience.pdf" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Open PDF →</a>
      <div class="reader-frame desktop-only"></div>
    </div>

    <div class="card reveal">
      <h2>What can historic artist–label copyright disputes teach us about AI-generated music and ownership?</h2>
      <div class="card-meta">NYU · Essay · 2025</div>
      <p><em>"The labels argue that Suno extracted the likeness of copyrighted works for its own gain without fairly compensating, drawing parallels to earlier challenges over uncredited session musicians, the faceless labour of 1920s sidemen now mirroring today's anonymous datasets that feed generative systems."</em></p>
      <button class="read-btn desktop-only" data-pdf="true" data-src="/assets/writing/NYU%20Coursework%20Essay.pdf">▶&nbsp; Read inline</button>
      <a class="mobile-link mobile-only" href="/assets/writing/NYU%20Coursework%20Essay.pdf" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Open PDF →</a>
      <div class="reader-frame desktop-only"></div>
    </div>

    <div class="card reveal">
      <h2>Which emerging opportunities and risks in Australia's live music ecosystem present the most meaningful areas for research?</h2>
      <div class="card-meta">NYU · Essay · 2025</div>
      <p><em>"These venues not only provide spaces for artists to perform, but are immersive environments that merge architecture, sound, food and art to provide a uniquely holistic experience to the point where audiences attend not only for the performances but to experience the aesthetic of the venues as well."</em></p>
      <button class="read-btn desktop-only" data-pdf="true" data-src="/assets/writing/NYU%20Music%20Business%20Admission%20Essay.pdf">▶&nbsp; Read inline</button>
      <a class="mobile-link mobile-only" href="/assets/writing/NYU%20Music%20Business%20Admission%20Essay.pdf" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Open PDF →</a>
      <div class="reader-frame desktop-only"></div>
    </div>
  </div>
</BaseLayout>
